msgstr "变更："

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:402
msgid "Classic (green/red)"
msgstr "经典（绿/红）"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2234
msgid "Classic uses green/red; Accessible uses teal/orange"
msgstr "经典使用绿/红；无障碍使用青绿/橙色"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/chips.js:148
msgid "Clear all"
msgstr "全部清除"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2333
msgid ""
"Click a cell to filter · ≠ on a chip to exclude · Ctrl+click a rule for "
"firewall settings · in Simple view, click a row for the full message"
msgstr ""
"点击单元格筛选 · 点击筛选标签上的 ≠ 排除 · Ctrl+点击规则打开防火墙设置 · 简洁"
"视图下点击行查看完整消息"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2403
msgid ""
"Click a row (Time or other non-link cells) to see the full log line (Simple "
"view)."
msgstr "点击行（时间或其他非链接单元格）可查看完整日志行（简洁视图）。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:139
msgid "Click a row for the full message"
msgstr "点击行可查看完整消息"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2408
msgid ""
"Click an IP, action, or protocol to filter; use the Protocol menu (or ≠ on a "
"chip) to exclude."
msgstr ""
"点击 IP、动作或协议进行筛选；使用协议菜单（或筛选标签上的 ≠）进行排除。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1558
msgid "Common"
msgstr "常用"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1394
msgid "Connection lost — retrying…"
msgstr "连接已断开 — 正在重试…"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:746
msgid "Could not disable logging."
msgstr "无法禁用日志记录。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:709
msgid "Could not enable logging."
msgstr "无法启用日志记录。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2288
msgid "Custom protocol (prefix ! to exclude). Overrides the menu when set."
msgstr "自定义协议（前缀 ! 表示排除）。填写后覆盖菜单选择。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:45
