msgid "Display limited to %d rows on this device"
msgstr "此设备上的显示已限制为 %d 行"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2168
msgid "Display options"
msgstr "显示选项"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2367
msgid "Display options on the bar set Limit, row tint, palette, and hostnames."
msgstr "栏上的显示选项可设置行数限制、行着色、配色和主机名。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:146
msgid "Does not change:"
msgstr "不更改："

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:163
msgid "Don’t show this again"
msgstr "不再显示"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:178
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:304
msgid "Enable WAN drop/reject logging"
msgstr "启用 WAN 丢弃/拒绝日志"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:124
msgid "Enable WAN zone drop/reject logging (same as Network → Firewall)."
msgstr "启用 WAN 区域的丢弃/拒绝日志记录（同 网络 → 防火墙）。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:130
msgid "Enable logging"
msgstr "启用日志"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2362
msgid ""
"Enable logging turns on WAN zone drop/reject logging only (same as Network → "
"Firewall). It does not add rules or log normal LAN browsing."
msgstr ""
"启用日志仅开启 WAN 区域的丢弃/拒绝日志记录（同 网络 → 防火墙），不会添加规"
"则，也不会记录正常的 LAN 浏览。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:130
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:178
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:304
msgid "Enabling…"
msgstr "正在启用…"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1571
msgid "Exclude"
msgstr "排除"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/chips.js:84
msgid "Exclude instead"
msgstr "改为排除"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2182
msgid "Fetch budget"
msgstr "抓取配额"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2372
msgid ""
"Fetch budget controls raw log lines per poll. Auto derives from Limit; "
"Manual selects a bounded maximum."
msgstr ""
"抓取配额控制每次轮询的原始日志行数。「自动」由行数限制推导；「手动」可选择一"
"个有上限的最大值。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/links.js:59
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/links.js:80
msgid "Filter by %s"
msgstr "按 %s 筛选"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/links.js:154
msgid "Filter by interface"
msgstr "按接口筛选"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/links.js:127
msgid "Filter logs by rule (hint: %s). Ctrl+click to open firewall settings."
msgstr "按规则筛选日志（提示：%s）。Ctrl+点击可打开防火墙设置。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2021
#: 标准输入:3
msgid "Firewall Live View"
msgstr "防火墙实时视图"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:46
msgid "Flags"
msgstr "标志"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:48
msgid "Flow"
msgstr "流向"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2382
msgid ""
"For a responsive table on a weak device, keep Limit at 250 rows or below. "
"The weak-device cap affects rendered rows; the buffer can still retain more."
msgstr ""
"为了在性能较弱的设备上保持表格流畅，请将「行数限制」保持在 250 行或以下。弱设"
"备上限影响渲染行数；缓冲区仍可保留更多。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/标准输入:3
msgid "Grant access to firewall live log view"
msgstr "授予防火墙实时日志视图的访问权限"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2353
msgid "Help"
msgstr "帮助"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1306
msgid "Hide rows"
msgstr "隐藏行"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1346
msgid ""
"High event rate — table refresh is throttled to protect the browser. The "
"buffer still updates; refresh will resume automatically."
msgstr ""
"事件速率过高 — 已限制表格刷新以保护浏览器。缓冲区仍在更新；刷新将自动恢复。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1220
msgid "Hostname resolve paused while the router is under load."
msgstr "路由器负载较高，已暂停主机名解析。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1562
msgid "ICMPv6"
msgstr "ICMPv6"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:38
msgid "IN"
msgstr "IN"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2421
msgid ""
"If Row tint looks missing, the active LuCI theme may omit success/error or "
"info/warn CSS variables; fwlive falls back to local colors (air-gapped, no "
"data leaves the device)."
msgstr ""
"如果行着色看起来缺失，当前 LuCI 主题可能未提供成功/错误或信息/警告 CSS 变量；"
"fwlive 会回退到本地颜色（隔离运行，数据不会离开本设备）。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:258
msgid ""
"If the WAN is quiet, wait for probes or use the optional ping check in "
"Help / the enabling-logs guide."
msgstr ""
"如果 WAN 侧较安静，请等待探测报文，或使用「帮助」/启用日志指南中的可选 ping "
"检查。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/chips.js:84
msgid "Include instead"
msgstr "改为包含"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/log.js:329
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:37
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "接口"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2303
msgid "Interface (prefix ! to exclude)"
msgstr "接口（前缀 ! 表示排除）"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:196
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:307
msgid "I’ll configure this under Network → Firewall"
msgstr "稍后我会在 网络 → 防火墙 中配置"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:230
msgid "Kernel log modules missing"
msgstr "缺少内核日志模块"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:234
msgid ""
"Kernel netfilter log modules are missing. Install kmod-nf-log-ipv4 and kmod-"
"nf-log-ipv6 (or kmod-nf-log / kmod-nf-log6), then reload the firewall."
msgstr ""
"缺少内核 netfilter 日志模块。请安装 kmod-nf-log-ipv4 和 kmod-nf-log-ipv6（或 "
"kmod-nf-log / kmod-nf-log6），然后重新加载防火墙。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:47
msgid "Len"
msgstr "长度"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2171
msgid "Limit"
msgstr "行数限制"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:661
msgid "Limited diagnostics — timeout command missing"
msgstr "诊断功能受限 — 缺少 timeout 命令"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:266
msgid "Logging is off on this router"
msgstr "此路由器的日志记录已关闭"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1182
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1234
msgid "Manual"
msgstr "手动"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2204
msgid "Manual still uses server protection and poll cadence"
msgstr "手动模式仍受服务器保护和轮询节奏约束"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2377
msgid ""
"Manual still uses server protection and poll cadence; it changes the fetch "
"budget, not the polling interval."
msgstr ""
"手动模式仍受服务器保护和轮询节奏约束；它改变的是抓取配额，而不是轮询间隔。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:327
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:337
msgid "Manual test (System → Terminal):"
msgstr "手动测试（系统 → 终端）："

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2197
msgid "Maximum raw lines"
msgstr "最大原始行数"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:49
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:328
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2106
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2113
msgid "Message"
msgstr "消息"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2298
msgid "More filters"
msgstr "更多筛选"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/links.js:41
msgid "Network → Firewall"
msgstr "网络 → 防火墙"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:221
msgid ""
"No WAN firewall zone found in /etc/config/firewall. Configure zones under:"
msgstr ""
"在 /etc/config/firewall 中未找到 WAN 防火墙区域。请在以下位置配置区域："

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:218
msgid "No WAN zone found"
msgstr "未找到 WAN 区域"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:193
msgid "Not now"
msgstr "暂不"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:289
msgid "Nothing changes until you click Enable."
msgstr "点击「启用」之前不会有任何更改。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/table.js:39
msgid "OUT"
msgstr "OUT"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2136
msgid "One line"
msgstr "单行"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:262
msgid "Open firewall zone settings"
msgstr "打开防火墙区域设置"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/fwlive/logging.js:270
msgid ""
"OpenWrt does not write firewall events to the log until you turn logging on. "
"Live View only shows what the firewall already logs — it does not add allow/"
"deny rules."
msgstr ""
"开启日志记录之前，OpenWrt 不会将防火墙事件写入日志。实时视图只显示防火墙已记"
"录的内容 — 它不会添加允许/拒绝规则。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2227
msgid "Palette"
msgstr "配色"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:1442
#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2060
msgid "Pause"
msgstr "暂停"

