#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2387
msgid ""
"Switching tabs pauses polling; returning performs one catch-up poll. "
"Hostnames are off by default because lookups add work."
msgstr ""
"切换标签页会暂停轮询；返回时执行一次追赶轮询。主机名默认关闭，因为解析会增加"
"开销。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2397
msgid ""
"The rate shown for WAN logging is the firewall zone log_limit. OpenWrt "
"defaults to 10/minute when no explicit limit is configured; fwlive does not "
"impose this cap."
msgstr ""
"WAN 日志显示的速率是防火墙区域的 log_limit。未显式配置时 OpenWrt 默认为 10 "
"条/分钟；此上限并非 fwlive 施加。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2392
msgid ""
"The router log ring may evict older events before fwlive reads them. fwlive "
"cannot recover evicted entries or change forwarding behavior."
msgstr ""
"路由器日志环形缓冲区可能在 fwlive 读取之前淘汰较旧的事件。fwlive 无法恢复已淘"
"汰的条目，也不会改变转发行为。"

#: openwrt-feed/luci-app-fwlive/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/status/fwlive.js:2357
msgid ""
"The table updates automatically when your firewall logs traffic. Use Pause "
"if it moves too fast."
msgstr "防火墙记录流量时表格会自动更新。如果滚动太快，请使用「暂停」。"

